#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane.rst:5 851ee3f553404466a918d3a58037f3da
msgid "Wind Vane"
msgstr "风向标"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane.rst:7 29427fd2feef4cde9f551e7dc6d3f653
msgid ""
"A wind vane is used to sense both the speed and direction of the apparent "
"wind; this can then be used to calculate the true wind speed and direction. "
"Wind vanes are only supported for Rover sailing vehicles. All wind vane "
"parameters can be found by searching for the prefix :ref:`WNDVN "
"<WNDVN_TYPE>`."
msgstr ""
"风向标用于感测表观风速和风向，进而可用于计算真实风速和风向。风向标仅支持 Rover 帆船车辆。所有风向标参数均可通过搜索前缀 :ref:`WNDVN "
"<WNDVN_TYPE>` 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane.rst:15 96b4d643b47240e8ac1139d56e1579f1
msgid ""
"For best results wind sensors should be mounted as high as possible away "
"from any part of the vehicle that may disturb the air flow around the vane"
msgstr "为获得最佳效果，风速传感器应安装在尽可能高的位置，远离可能干扰风向标气流的车辆任何部件。"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane.rst:17 dc79db54ad424f699c95132c3e61826a
msgid ""
"Some wind sensors can be used to sense both the wind speed and direction. In"
" this case both :ref:`WNDVN_TYPE <WNDVN_TYPE>` and :ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE "
"<WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE>` should be set to the same value. If a sensor reports "
"both speed and direction it is still possible to use only the speed or "
"direction by setting the :ref:`WNDVN_TYPE <WNDVN_TYPE>` or "
":ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE <WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE>` to a alternative sensor. Note "
"that any change to the _TYPE parameters will require a re-boot to take "
"effect"
msgstr ""
"某些风速传感器可同时感测风速和风向。在这种情况下，:ref:`WNDVN_TYPE <WNDVN_TYPE>` 和 "
":ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE <WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE>` 应设为相同的值。如果传感器同时报告速度和方向，仍可通过将 "
":ref:`WNDVN_TYPE <WNDVN_TYPE>` 或 :ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE <WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE>` "
"设为替代传感器来仅使用速度或方向。注意，对 _TYPE 参数的任何更改均需重启才能生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane.rst:29 6f722fc03f6f440181ce785111d940ae
msgid "Wind Direction"
msgstr "风向"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane.rst:30 0d485f5e4f0a45f9b25ac915d1db8835
msgid ""
"Wind direction can be directly sensed through the use of an analogue voltage"
" input. However it is also possible to use a fixed wind direction, this is "
"not recommended for long term use, but will allow testing of sailboats "
"without the need for specialist sensors. The wind vane type can be selected "
"with :ref:`WNDVN_TYPE <WNDVN_TYPE>`. The wind direction is filtered using a "
"low pass filter, the frequency of this filter can be set using "
":ref:`WNDVN_DIR_FILT <WNDVN_DIR_FILT>`. If the wind direction is oscillating"
" this frequency can be reduced. This will reduce the effect of fast "
"oscillating wind shifts but will also reduce the response time to a change "
"in wind direction."
msgstr ""
"风向可通过模拟电压输入直接感测。也可使用固定风向，但不建议长期使用，仅允许在无需专用传感器的情况下测试帆船功能。风向标类型可通过 "
":ref:`WNDVN_TYPE <WNDVN_TYPE>` 选择。风向通过低通滤波器进行滤波，滤波器频率可通过 "
":ref:`WNDVN_DIR_FILT <WNDVN_DIR_FILT>` "
"设置。如果风向出现振荡，可降低此频率。这将减少快速振荡风向变化的影响，但也会降低对风向变化的响应速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane.rst:36 02aaa32e90a0413189c8256e07ca4a14
msgid ""
"If a wind speed sensor is also fitted the :ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_MIN "
"<WNDVN_SPEED_MIN>` speed can be set. At wind speeds less than this the "
"direction reading will be ignored, this allows the vane to be ignored when "
"it may be stuck or inaccurate due to a temporary drop in wind. Keep in mind "
"that if the wind is consistently less than this value the vehicle will have "
"no new information about wind direction."
msgstr ""
"如果同时安装了风速传感器，可设置 :ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_MIN <WNDVN_SPEED_MIN>` "
"最低风速。当风速低于此值时，方向读数将被忽略，这允许在风向标可能卡住或因临时风力不足而不准确时将其忽略。请注意，如果风速持续低于此值，车辆将无法获得任何新的风向信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane.rst:48 a02d31a34bea44acab3d8e12a7b4d2b5
msgid "Wind Speed"
msgstr "风速"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane.rst:50 59835f210e194dc2b255c46bccd156bd
msgid ""
"A wind speed sensor is not absolutely required to get a sailing vehicle to "
"work well. If one is not fitted apparent wind effects are ignored, for "
"vehicles that move slowly in comparison to the wind speed this will have "
"little effect however, if possible, it is always better to have a wind speed"
" sensor. The wind speed sensor type can be changed with "
":ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE <WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE>`. The wind speed is filtered using"
" a low pass filter, the frequency of this filter can be set using "
":ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_FILT <WNDVN_SPEED_FILT>`."
msgstr ""
"风速传感器并非帆船车辆正常运作的绝对必要条件。若未安装，表观风效应将被忽略；对于与风速相比移动缓慢的车辆，影响不大；但若条件允许，安装风速传感器始终更佳。风速传感器类型可通过"
" :ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE <WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE>` 更改。风速通过低通滤波器进行滤波，滤波器频率可通过 "
":ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_FILT <WNDVN_SPEED_FILT>` 设置。"
